{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Whitehead乘积"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Whitehead 乘积”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitehead_product\" title=\"Wiki [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitehead_product]\">Wiki</a></span></p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>给定 $f \\in \\pi_k(X), g \\in \\pi_l(X)$, 其 Whitehead 乘积 $[f,g] \\in \\pi_{k+l-1}(X)$ 定义如下.</p>\n<p>球的乘积 $S^k \\times S^l$ 可视为一点并 $S^k \\vee S^l$ 粘上一个 $(k+l)$-胞腔, 设其粘贴映射为 $\\phi \\colon S^{k+l-1} \\to S^k \\vee S^l$. 定义\n$$\r\n[f,g] \\colon  S^{k+l-1} \\overset{\\phi}{\\to} S^k\\vee S^l \\overset{f\\vee g}{\\to} X.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>特别地, $\\pi_1(X)$ 可作用于每个 $\\pi_k(X)$ 上.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>双线性性</strong>. 对 $g,h\\in\\pi_l(X)$, $[f,g+h] = [f,g]+[f,h]$.</p>\n<p><strong>分次交换性</strong>. $[f,g] = (-1)^{kl}[g,f]$.</p>\n<p><strong>分次 Jacobi 恒等式</strong>. $(-1)^{kl}[[f,g],h] + \\cdots = 0$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>记 $\\operatorname{id} \\colon S^2 \\to S^2$ 为恒等映射, $\\eta \\colon S^3 \\to S^2$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hopf纤维化","text":"Hopf 纤维化"}},{"Plain":", 则有 $[\\operatorname{id},\\operatorname{id}] = 2\\eta$. 参见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hopf不变量","text":"Hopf 不变量"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}